{{~
# Admissibility, written by the code as practitioners open the discussion: the CPCA articles every requête must meet
# (standing, a written petition, its mandatory particulars, the fees), and for a family case the territorial
# jurisdiction of art. 426. The Form Engine checks the art. 15 particulars; the lawyer answers for the rest.
~}}
حيث إن هذه العريضة جاءت مستوفية للشروط المنصوص عليها قانونا، سيما المواد 13 و14 و15 و17{{ if (area court.section) == "family" }} و426{{ end }} من قانون الإجراءات المدنية والإدارية، مما يتعين معه قبولها شكلا.
